          "label": "src/features/point-cloud/README.md point-cloud acquisition owner block 1",
          "before": "Shader source, coordinate conversion, point order/identity, color thresholds, alpha policy, attribute/depth ordering, GL deletion list and lasso attribute lookup/upload behavior are preserved. Changes to those policies belong in a separate behavior change. In particular, do not infer new lasso shader behavior or expanded buffer deletion from this structural extraction.\n\nRegistration now remembers the creating viewer so cleanup can still target it after the runtime viewer reference is replaced or cleared. The scene-layer owner retains confirmed features and ObjectID maps. Runtime retains lasso hit testing, calibration/crop intent, geometry preparation, acquisition and follow scheduling. A broader cloud controller is still pending; do not move the whole widget into this renderer owner.\n\n## Verification\n",
          "after": "Shader source, coordinate conversion, point order/identity, color thresholds, alpha policy, attribute/depth ordering, GL deletion list and lasso attribute lookup/upload behavior are preserved. Changes to those policies belong in a separate behavior change. In particular, do not infer new lasso shader behavior or expanded buffer deletion from this structural extraction.\n\nRegistration now remembers the creating viewer so cleanup can still target it after the runtime viewer reference is replaced or cleared. The scene-layer owner retains confirmed features and ObjectID maps. Runtime retains lasso hit testing, calibration/crop intent and geometry preparation; `PointCloudAcquisition` owns acquisition and follow scheduling. A broader cloud controller is still pending; do not move the whole widget into this renderer owner.\n\n## Verification\n"
